The '''Ootmian Pabol''' was a [[Hyperspace route|hyperlane]] within [[Hutt Space]]. The [[Delphanian]] [[privateer]] [[Sidon Ithano]] carried a [[letter of marque]] that gave him license to conduct raids along the Ootmian Pabol, [[Pabol Hutta]], [[Shag Pabol]], and all secular hyperlanes in [[Hutt]] Space. The letter also allowed him to deliver any seized cargoes from these raids to his patron Hutt [[kajidic]]s, the [[Desilijic]], [[Ramesh]], [[Besadii]], [[Gnuda]], and [[Shell]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Ootmian Pabol was first mentioned in the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]] on a supplemental item included in the deluxe edition of the [[2018]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: Smuggler's Guide]]'', which was written by [[Daniel Wallace]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

